1..8
ok 1 - can create TCP UNIX socket servers
ok 2 - can create TCP UNIX socket clients
ok 3 - can accept connections to TCP UNIX socket servers
ok 4 - can write data to TCP UNIX sockets
ok 5 - can receive data from TCP UNIX sockets...
ok 6 - ...which matches the original data sent
ok 7 - can close TCP UNIX socket clients
ok 8 - can close TCP UNIX socket servers
